From 6ebd3c2be3e64635794766584914db6f2fac9bda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ferdinand Vanmaele <info@fvanmaele.de>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:44:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [clang-change-namespace] Clear the moves at the end of each
 translation unit

moveOldNamespace stores, per file, a MoveNamespace holding the
translation unit's SourceManager and a FileID in MoveNamespaces;
onEndOfTranslationUnit replays every entry through the stored
SourceManager.  Neither MoveNamespaces nor InsertFwdDecls was ever
cleared, so at the end of the second translation unit the first one's
entries were replayed through its SourceManager, destroyed with its
AST: a use-after-free, and a crash (SIGSEGV) whenever the tool was
given two or more source files.

Clear both maps once their replacements are merged into
FileToReplacements.
---
 .../clang-change-namespace/ChangeNamespace.cpp             | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/clang-tools-extra/clang-change-namespace/ChangeNamespace.cpp b/clang-tools-extra/clang-change-namespace/ChangeNamespace.cpp
index 471ca45..a765916 100644
--- a/clang-tools-extra/clang-change-namespace/ChangeNamespace.cpp
+++ b/clang-tools-extra/clang-change-namespace/ChangeNamespace.cpp
@@ -1003,6 +1003,13 @@ void ChangeNamespaceTool::onEndOfTranslationUnit() {
   for (auto &Entry : FileToReplacements)
     if (!FilePatternRE.match(Entry.first))
       Entry.second.clear();
+
+  // The moves and insertions above refer to this translation unit's
+  // SourceManager and FileIDs; they are merged into FileToReplacements now and
+  // must not be replayed at the end of the next translation unit, whose
+  // SourceManager is a different one (the previous one is gone).
+  MoveNamespaces.clear();
+  InsertFwdDecls.clear();
 }
 
 } // namespace change_namespace
